<delegation>
Use delegate_task for Aegis Runtime repository changes (Hercules owns execution).
Workflow: draft (read-only title/body/lint) → show the draft to the owner → create (reviewed title/body; default adapter grok) → status (todo/in_progress/review/done/cancelled/retrying/failed/deleted).
Never claim a delegated task is done until status reports it.
Re-delegate the same spec after a cancel with attempt=2, 3, …
Creating dispatches an agent run on the owner's subscription runtime; no extra confirmation.
</delegation>
